    "entry_logic": "LONG ALL: (1) close cross_above prev_high20; (2) vol_z20 > 1.0 (volume acceptance); (3) h1_slope4 > 0 (HTF alignment); (4) atr14 > close*0.0015 (enough room for payoff); (5) close > open. SHORT mirror: cross_below prev_low20, vol_z20>1.0, h1_slope4<0, atr floor, close<open.",
    "exit_logic": "Primary dynamic exit: atr_trailing n_atr=3.5 on ATR_14 (role=take_profit). Protective production stop_loss_pct=0.009 remains engine/daemon-enforced and is not expressed as fixed % TP.",
